WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.961
DNA only gets built one way.

00:00:02.042 --> 00:00:02.669
Here's why.

00:00:03.006 --> 00:00:04.643
Every strand has two different ends.

00:00:04.887 --> 00:00:05.897
The 5-prime end.

00:00:06.118 --> 00:00:07.267
And the 3-prime end.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.159
New pieces can only snap onto the

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:09.984
3-prime end.

00:00:10.169 --> 00:00:12.178
So new DNA always grows 5-prime to

00:00:12.259 --> 00:00:12.863
3-prime.

00:00:13.316 --> 00:00:13.896
One way.

00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:14.929
Every time.

00:00:15.266 --> 00:00:16.636
But it can't start from nothing.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:17.797
Swipe.
